Exceptions and attributions

- The supplier performance matrix (data/performance_matrix.json, the "ranking" block of
  problems/supplier_selection.json) and the data report embedded in prompts/guided/ are derived from the
  Kaggle "Procurement KPI Analysis Dataset". The terms of that dataset apply to the derived values in addition
  to this notice; see DATA_PROVENANCE.md.
